      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あやつはいろいろと逸話の多い\r\n黒魔道士じゃ。\r\n放っておけばひどい騒ぎになるかもしれん。",
        "official_en": "Her past is tainted by dark rumors, you see. Wherever she goes, turmoil is bound to follow.",
        "real_en": "There are all sorts of stories about that black mage. If we leave her alone, she might cause a terrible commotion."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
